  "title": "Cookie Pie",
  "description": "This pie wins the prize for simplest and most delicious. Thin, chocolate wafer cookies and a whipped topping are layered in a graham cracker crust and chilled until set. Dust with cocoa or sprinkle with shaved chocolate.",
